  "about": "Tonight's daily suggestion order, shared by CaveKit (TonightTests.swift) and the Android core (TonightTest.kt). rank is the 64-bit FNV-1a hash, in hexadecimal, of the UTF-8 text \"<lowercase wine id>|<yyyy-MM-dd>\"; order lists the wine ids by rank, smallest first. picks are Tonight's suggestions in a cellar on the given day (year 2026): each wine has 'free' bottles (default 1) and 'reserved' ones kept for an occasion (default 0), drinkable from 'from' (default 2020) until 'until'; order is tonightPicks: the wines to drink soon (until the year) first, then the ready ones, each by rank, with 'kept' first when it is a candidate. Ids compare ignoring case. bottleToOpen is the bottle Drink and Tonight open for a wine: the oldest free bottle (addedAt), ties broken by the id compared as text ignoring case; a bottle kept for an occasion only when no bottle is free.",
